.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH trellis-ci-matrix 1 "" trellis "Trellis Manual"
.SH NAME
trellis\-ci\-matrix \- Emit a GitHub Actions strategy matrix: {"include":[{name,path,version},…]}
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrellis ci matrix\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-directory\fR] [\fB\-\-since\fR] [\fB\-\-releasable\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Emit a GitHub Actions strategy matrix: {"include":[{name,path,version},…]}
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-directory\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Run as if started in this directory
.TP
\fB\-\-since\fR \fI<REF>\fR
Only members affected by changes since this git ref (dependents included)
.TP
\fB\-\-releasable\fR
Only members that participate in releases
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
